[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32300100_02_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32300100_02_0010","text":"啊，小糸酱\n头"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32300100_02_0015","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32300100_02_0020","text":"真的耶～\n粘了什么东西哦～？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32300100_02_0030","text":"诶……\n什、什么…………？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32300100_02_0040","text":"是什么呢～\n虫子之类的？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32300100_02_0050","text":"────诶……！？\n帮、帮我拿掉…………！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32300100_02_0060","text":"……雏菜"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32300100_02_0070","text":"……啊～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32300100_02_0080","text":"拿、拿掉了……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32300100_02_0090","text":"嗯～！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32300100_02_0100","text":"圆香前辈～\n不是虫子，是树叶哦～？"}]
